{"id":1258,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>2024 年 10 月 18 日，中北大学艺术学院“秋意浓”教师摄影活动在一片浓郁的秋意中拉开帷幕。为了留住这如诗如画的深秋美景，艺术学院向全体教师发出了诚挚的邀请，希望老师们用手机相册记录下眼中的深秋。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=JL870so7lsLR9YUamliMmN8L7WRU4QPfMlliU4L8nzfRL8C0gihFp2hmCIa0USyPMYyPokhfoRUDn7-8nlCaM7l4L4AfUlM7MmviLz-inmQFMlWVMR6kM8MFMlLaL7lJv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0LzvPLmCJqdYnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=17126&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A1718A846DB4EF04E338AACD675125F6/5BE47B7C/5C00E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=JL870so7lsLR9YUamliMmN8L7WRU4QPfMlliU4L8nzfRL8C0gihFp2hmCIa0USyPMYyPokhfoRUDn7-8nlCaM7l4L4AfUlM7MmviLz-inmQFMlWVMR6kM8MFMlLaL7lJv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0LzvPLmCJqdYnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=17126&e=.png\"></p><p>活动一经推出，便得到了老师们的积极响应。他们纷纷走出教室、办公室，漫步在校园的各个角落，用心去感受秋天的气息，用镜头去捕捉秋天的美丽。有的老师聚焦于校园中那棵古老的银杏树，用细腻的画面展现出银杏叶在阳光下闪耀的金色光芒；有的老师则将目光投向校园里的小花园，捕捉到菊花在秋风中傲然绽放的姿态；还有的老师把镜头对准了校园里的学生们，记录下他们在秋日暖阳下的青春活力。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=JUNW0VnRQ7oRv8MalVVM4QkMzLZozlPaMlVkolWVnlCPL7l0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yPLYhfLShkM4MVL8VfLR98olUsMmG4LmC4nNLYU4-DnlnFnmCbMm-bLlQFMmG4ozCJv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0LzvPLmCJqdYnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=17126&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B13A1B73E3AA0849D7603263FC2C26ED/F696291F/60396\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=JUNW0VnRQ7oRv8MalVVM4QkMzLZozlPaMlVkolWVnlCPL7l0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yPLYhfLShkM4MVL8VfLR98olUsMmG4LmC4nNLYU4-DnlnFnmCbMm-bLlQFMmG4ozCJv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0LzvPLmCJqdYnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=17126&e=.png\"></p><p>此次摄影活动不仅丰富了教师们的业余生活，也为他们提供了一个展示艺术才华的平台。通过摄影，老师们用自己独特的视角和创意，诠释了对秋天的理解和感悟。同时，这些摄影作品也将成为艺术学院珍贵的文化资源，为校园文化建设增添一抹亮丽的色彩。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=JMlr0kLlV7UzlbMa4UDnNCYUzfVMzAPRUlrVnRrkM4LbnRU0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhfMkh7nkyZLRl4nRLDLmviozCioRGbUm7YMmUiUNUZL7MFUm9bMmGYUmQFMmfVU4NJv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0LzvPLmCJqdYnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=17126&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/DA4DD8053D36275965809B12645BD80C/B89602B6/60EC9\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=JMlr0kLlV7UzlbMa4UDnNCYUzfVMzAPRUlrVnRrkM4LbnRU0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhfMkh7nkyZLRl4nRLDLmviozCioRGbUm7YMmUiUNUZL7MFUm9bMmGYUmQFMmfVU4NJv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0LzvPLmCJqdYnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=17126&e=.png\"></p><p>在这个充满诗意的秋天里，艺术学院的老师们用镜头定格了美好的瞬间，让秋意永远留在了心中。相信在今后的日子里，艺术学院的老师们将继续用他们的创造力和热情，为校园文化建设贡献更多的力量。</p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p>一审：陆晨曦</p><p>二审：郭云霞</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://art.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=JL870so7lsLR9YUamliMmN8L7WRU4QPfMlliU4L8nzfRL8C0gihFp2hmCIa0USyPMYyPokhfoRUDn7-8nlCaM7l4L4AfUlM7MmviLz-inmQFMlWVMR6kM8MFMlLaL7lJv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0LzvPLmCJqdYnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=17126&e=.png"}